 "fylite:page": "evolve",
 "fylite:case": {
  "fylite:name": "FUSE · MANTA（输入对照，不是 FUSE 的答案）",
  "fylite:name_en": "FUSE · MANTA (inputs only, not FUSE's answer)",
  "fylite:note": "★★<strong>这不是 FUSE 的答案，是 FUSE 的输入。</strong>MANTA 这一档的机器、成分与注入功率取自 FUSE 的 <code>case_parameters(:MANTA)</code>（commit <code>494d565</code>，<code>src/cases/MANTA.jl</code>）；而 FUSE 给出的<strong>结果</strong>来自 <code>ActorStationaryPlasma</code>——TGLF 通量匹配加 EPED 台基的迭代，本栏走的是<strong>规定 χ 的推进</strong>。χ₀ = 0.4 m²/s 是本仓 ITER 对标（对 ASTRA）定下的，<strong>没有为这台机器重新标定过</strong>，FUSE 也从来没给过它。所以这一档跑出来的数<strong>不能拿去和 FUSE 对</strong>——能对的是下面那张表里标着 FUSE 的那些格。 ★<strong>本仓不携带 FUSE 的任何东西</strong>：这份文档里是从一个 FUSE 检出里读出的标量，出处逐条写在下面；源码与数据文件都没有进仓。 ★控件 · FUSE 的值 · 落到控件 · 出处： · <code>amin</code> · 1.2 · <strong>1.2</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] a = R₀ϵ = 4.55×0.263736 · <code>rmaj</code> · 3.79167 · <strong>3.8</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] R/a = 1/ϵ = 3.79167 · <code>kappa</code> · 1.4 · <strong>1.4</strong> · [FUSE] boundary_from=:scalars，κ 与 δ 直接取 · <code>delta</code> · -0.45 · <strong>-0.46</strong> · [FUSE] boundary_from=:scalars，κ 与 δ 直接取 · <code>bunit</code> · 11 · <strong>11</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.B0（取模） · <code>ip</code> · 1e+07 · <strong>10000</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.ip，A → kA · <code>q95</code> · — · <strong>3.5</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] FUSE 不给 q₉₅（它由平衡解出）；用柱近似加形状因子估：5a²B/(R₀I_p) = 1.741，形状因子 1.984（★是估计，不是 FUSE 的答案） · <code>zeff</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.zeff · <code>cimp</code> · — · <strong>0.08</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] 由控件 Z_eff 反解本栏的 1 + c·Z(Z−1)，Z(Kr) = 36；落格后隐含 Z_eff = 2.008 · <code>dtfrac</code> · — · <strong>0.45</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] 准中性：2f + 2f_He + Z·c = 1，f_He = 0.025，得 f = 0.4606 · <code>species</code> · Kr · <strong>Kr</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.impurity · <code>peakt</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_shaping · <code>peakn</code> · 4 · <strong>4</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.ne_shaping · <code>te0</code> · 20000 · <strong>20</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_core，eV → keV · <code>ti0</code> · — · <strong>20</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] T_i(0) = T_e(0) × Ti_Te_ratio = 1 · <code>edgene</code> · — · <strong>10.2</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] ne_setting = :greenwald_fraction 定的是**线/体平均**，本栏没有这一格：按本栏自己的剖面 n = n_e + (n₀−n_e)(1−x²)^4（体平均 = n_e + (n₀−n_e)/(p+1)）与芯/台基比 1.429 联立解出，⟨n_e⟩ = 11.05×10¹⁹ · <code>ne0</code> · — · <strong>14.5</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] FUSE 不给芯部密度（它是通量匹配的结果）；芯/台基比沿用本仓 ITER 档的 10.0/7.0 = 1.43 · <code>edgete</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] ★FUSE 这一档是 :L_mode，没有台基；填一个 L 模边界 0.3 keV · <code>edgeti</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] 同上 · <code>pe</code> · — · <strong>0</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] ★分配是本工具的约定，不是 FUSE 的：EC 0 + LH 0 + NB 0/2 → 电子 · IC 40 + NB 0/2 → 离子 · <code>pi</code> · — · <strong>40</strong> · [由 FUSE 推出] 同上 · <code>pedestal</code> · — · <strong>False</strong> · [★本仓的，不是 FUSE 的] ★L 模，没有台基可开 ★<strong>落格</strong>（滑杆有自己的步长，文档写的就是页面真正持有的值，不是 FUSE 的原值）：<code>rmaj</code> 3.79167→3.8 · <code>delta</code> -0.45→-0.46 · <code>q95</code> 3.45358→3.5 · <code>cimp</code> 0.0793651→0.08 · <code>dtfrac</code> 0.4606→0.45 · <code>edgene</code> 10.1799→10.2 · <code>ne0</code> 14.5427→14.5 ★本栏其余控件（dt、步数、闭包、波与束流那几组）是本仓的缺省，FUSE 的 ini 里没有对应项。",
  "fylite:note_en": "★★<strong>This is FUSE's INPUT, not FUSE's ANSWER.</strong> The machine, composition and launched power of the MANTA case come from FUSE's <code>case_parameters(:MANTA)</code> (commit <code>494d565</code>, <code>src/cases/MANTA.jl</code>). FUSE's own answer comes out of <code>ActorStationaryPlasma</code> — a TGLF flux match with an EPED pedestal — whereas this bar marches a <strong>prescribed chi</strong>. chi_0 = 0.4 m^2/s is what this repository's ITER benchmark against ASTRA settled on; it was <strong>not re-derived for this machine</strong> and FUSE never stated it. So the numbers this case produces are <strong>not comparable with FUSE's</strong>; what is comparable is the half of the table below tagged FUSE. ★<strong>Nothing of FUSE's is carried in this repository</strong>: what is here are scalars read out of a FUSE checkout, each with its provenance below. No source and no data file was copied. ★control · FUSE · as held · provenance： · <code>amin</code> · 1.2 · <strong>1.2</strong> · [derived from FUSE] a = R₀ϵ = 4.55×0.263736 · <code>rmaj</code> · 3.79167 · <strong>3.8</strong> · [derived from FUSE] R/a = 1/ϵ = 3.79167 · <code>kappa</code> · 1.4 · <strong>1.4</strong> · [FUSE] boundary_from=:scalars，κ 与 δ 直接取 · <code>delta</code> · -0.45 · <strong>-0.46</strong> · [FUSE] boundary_from=:scalars，κ 与 δ 直接取 · <code>bunit</code> · 11 · <strong>11</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.B0（取模） · <code>ip</code> · 1e+07 · <strong>10000</strong> · [FUSE] ini.equilibrium.ip，A → kA · <code>q95</code> · — · <strong>3.5</strong> · [derived from FUSE] FUSE 不给 q₉₅（它由平衡解出）；用柱近似加形状因子估：5a²B/(R₀I_p) = 1.741，形状因子 1.984（★是估计，不是 FUSE 的答案） · <code>zeff</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.zeff · <code>cimp</code> · — · <strong>0.08</strong> · [derived from FUSE] 由控件 Z_eff 反解本栏的 1 + c·Z(Z−1)，Z(Kr) = 36；落格后隐含 Z_eff = 2.008 · <code>dtfrac</code> · — · <strong>0.45</strong> · [derived from FUSE] 准中性：2f + 2f_He + Z·c = 1，f_He = 0.025，得 f = 0.4606 · <code>species</code> · Kr · <strong>Kr</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.impurity · <code>peakt</code> · 2 · <strong>2</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_shaping · <code>peakn</code> · 4 · <strong>4</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.ne_shaping · <code>te0</code> · 20000 · <strong>20</strong> · [FUSE] ini.core_profiles.Te_core，eV → keV · <code>ti0</code> · — · <strong>20</strong> · [derived from FUSE] T_i(0) = T_e(0) × Ti_Te_ratio = 1 · <code>edgene</code> · — · <strong>10.2</strong> · [derived from FUSE] ne_setting = :greenwald_fraction 定的是**线/体平均**，本栏没有这一格：按本栏自己的剖面 n = n_e + (n₀−n_e)(1−x²)^4（体平均 = n_e + (n₀−n_e)/(p+1)）与芯/台基比 1.429 联立解出，⟨n_e⟩ = 11.05×10¹⁹ · <code>ne0</code> · — · <strong>14.5</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] FUSE 不给芯部密度（它是通量匹配的结果）；芯/台基比沿用本仓 ITER 档的 10.0/7.0 = 1.43 · <code>edgete</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] ★FUSE 这一档是 :L_mode，没有台基；填一个 L 模边界 0.3 keV · <code>edgeti</code> · — · <strong>0.3</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] 同上 · <code>pe</code> · — · <strong>0</strong> · [derived from FUSE] ★分配是本工具的约定，不是 FUSE 的：EC 0 + LH 0 + NB 0/2 → 电子 · IC 40 + NB 0/2 → 离子 · <code>pi</code> · — · <strong>40</strong> · [derived from FUSE] 同上 · <code>pedestal</code> · — · <strong>False</strong> · [★this repository, NOT FUSE] ★L 模，没有台基可开 ★<strong>Snapped to the slider lattice</strong> (the document states what the page actually holds, not FUSE's exact value): <code>rmaj</code> 3.79167→3.8 · <code>delta</code> -0.45→-0.46 · <code>q95</code> 3.45358→3.5 · <code>cimp</code> 0.0793651→0.08 · <code>dtfrac</code> 0.4606→0.45 · <code>edgene</code> 10.1799→10.2 · <code>ne0</code> 14.5427→14.5 ★Every other control of this bar (dt, step count, closure, the wave and beam groups) is this repository's default; FUSE's ini has no counterpart."
 },
